# JJ Voice Assistant Configuration
# 
# OPTIONAL: This file enables AI-powered website detection using Google's Gemini API
# The assistant works WITHOUT this file, but AI makes website detection smarter!
#
# To enable AI features:
# 1. Get a FREE API key from: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Replace "your_api_key_here" below with your actual API key
# 3. Save this file as ".env" (remove .example from filename)
# 4. Place it in the same folder as the .exe file

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
